# Whitelist: the image build compiles the crate from source, so the build stage
# needs the manifest, the sources, schema.sql (include_str! at compile time) and
# the prompt files. Target artifacts are not needed.
*
!backend
backend/*
!backend/Cargo.toml
!backend/Cargo.lock
!backend/schema.sql
!backend/src
!backend/src/**
!backend/app
!backend/app/**
# the SPA is baked into the image so `docker run` alone serves a UI
!web
!web/**
